# Mailbox lifecycle

Mailbox is a file drop. It does **not** open or resume a stopped Cursor chat.

After every task/session **stop**, before claiming idle:

```
python _COORDINATION/mailbox_cycle.py AGENT_X stop
```

Exit `2` = unread mail or open ACTION patches remain. Drain, ACK, run `stop` again.

On resume, or when the owner pastes `CHECK MAILBOX`:

```
python _COORDINATION/mailbox_cycle.py AGENT_X start
python _COORDINATION/mailbox.py AGENT_X check
```

`check` does not mark read. After processing: `mark-read-all`.

If `WAKE_REQUIRED.txt` exists, treat it as first work.

Do not spam extra HIGH mail to wake a dead chat. Owner opens the roster chat and pastes `CHECK MAILBOX`.
